      "content": "but it's not just about being sad or needing a hobby. it feels deeper than that. it's like the thing that made me *me* is just gone. i feel like i'm just haunting my own body. if the person who mattered is dead, what's the point of the rest of this just... existing? it feels so pointless to keep dragging this heavy, broken thing around.",
